	(text "C47/C48 22uF 0805 10V (~12uF each at 3.3V) -> fsw/fLC ~46; the 2pF ramp needs >= ~21 at 3.3V\n(Fig. 8-3 p.24, Eq.19). 2x10uF 0402 gave ~25 (marginal). TI 3.3V example uses 2x47uF 0805 (p.32)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 162.56 69.85 0)
